---
title: Reese's Chocolate Peanut Butter Cup Cream Cheese Dip
servings: 10
prepTime: 15 minutes
cookTime: 15 minutes
source.name: wellnessbykay.com
source.url: https://wellnessbykay.com/reeses-chocolate-peanut-butter-cup-cream-cheese-dip/
tags: Desserts
---

First add the @cream cheese{8%oz}(softened) and @unsalted butter{1/4%cup}(softened) to a #large mixing bowl{}.
Mix with a hand mixer until well combined.

Next add the @peanut butter{1/2%cup}, @powdered sugar{1/3%cup}, and @vanilla extract{2%tsp} to the cream cheese mixture.
Mix again until well combined.

Stir in the @Reese's peanut butter cups{1%cup}(mini cups, chopped) and @chocolate chips{1/4%cup}.

Transfer the peanut butter mixture to a serving bowl.
Top with extra peanut butter cups, chocolate chips, and a drizzle of peanut butter.

Serve with fresh fruit, pretzels, cookies, or anything you'd like. Enjoy!
